## 12. 命令设计

`spec-lab/package.json` 提供以下 scripts：

```json
{
  "scripts": {
    "spec:validate": "tsx gate/validateSpec.ts",
    "test:conformance": "tsx gate/conformance.ts",
    "gate:diff": "tsx gate/differential.ts",
    "trace:write": "tsx gate/writeTrace.ts",
    "verify": "pnpm spec:validate && pnpm test:conformance && pnpm gate:diff && pnpm trace:write"
  }
}
```

v0.1 必须支持：

```bash
cd spec-lab
pnpm verify
```

